   "text": "every branch ends REMOVE TAG → End Flow, and each Send Email step’s On bounced link leads to the same cleanup (V2): the spec carries it as onBounced, and the builder draws it (v52). A branch that just stops keeps in_flow_salespage_abandon, and that person never gets another broadcast. Send a test contact down each exit before switching the flow on."
